  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.8"/>
    <code code="51848-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Evaluation note"/>
    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>New firm lump in the upper outer quadrant of the left breast, found two weeks ago; clinically suspicious; diagnostic imaging and biopsy booked: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Duodenal ulcer found at endoscopy seven weeks ago, with Helicobacter pylori on biopsy; treated with 14 days of bismuth quadruple therapy and completing eight weeks of omeprazole; test of cure planned: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Primary osteoarthritis of both knees, mild, with stiffness after long walks on the shore: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.10" extension="2014-06-09"/>
    <code code="18776-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Plan of care note"/>
    <title>Plan of Treatment</title>
    <text><list><item>Diagnostic mammography and ultrasound of the left breast and axilla this week, then image-guided core biopsy with ER, PR, HER2, and Ki-67 testing. Guideline: NCCN Clinical Practice Guidelines in Oncology: Breast Cancer, Version 5.2025 (2025); CMID: Clinical Monitoring Intelligence Database, breast cancer monograph (2026) [S]</item><item>Disclosure and shared decision-making: ask what she wants to know, give each result in person and in plain words with a written copy, check understanding by teach-back, and make every decision with her; share her health information only with the people she names. Guideline: Code of Medical Ethics Opinion 2.1.3: Withholding Information from Patients (2016); Patient-Clinician Communication: American Society of Clinical Oncology Consensus Guideline. J Clin Oncol 2017;35(31):3618-3632 (2017) [S]</item><item>Test of cure for Helicobacter pylori by urea breath test at least four weeks after antibiotics and two weeks after stopping omeprazole. Guideline: ACG Clinical Guideline: Treatment of Helicobacter pylori Infection. Am J Gastroenterol 2024;119(9):1730-1753 (2024) [S]</item><item>Knee osteoarthritis: walking and strengthening exercise, acetaminophen as needed, no nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs after her ulcer. Guideline: 2019 American College of Rheumatology/Arthritis Foundation Guideline for the Management of Osteoarthritis of the Hand, Hip, and Knee (2019) [S]</item><item ID="referral-order">Referral to surgical oncology (breast), Henrietta Solís-Abernathy, MD, ordered 1960-03-09 [S]</item></list></text>

